# Copy to .dev.vars for local `wrangler dev` testing only.
# .dev.vars is gitignored — never commit real values.
#
# SITE_ID is NOT listed here on purpose: it's already a plain var in
# wrangler.jsonc, and every line in THIS file is prompted for as a required
# secret by the Cloudflare "Deploy to Cloudflare" button — duplicating it
# here makes the button ask for SITE_ID twice (once plain, once masked).
# For local dev, add SITE_ID=... to your own .dev.vars manually.
NORG_SITE_KEY=REPLACE_WITH_SITE_KEY
